Subject: [PATCH] PS2: timing panel covers the whole frame, pad, audio, ANM
 flush, present and the top chain callbacks

Diagnostic only. Adds timers around GameWindow::Render and its parts, the pad read, and per-callback
timing inside the update and draw chains (top 6 of each shown by address). The panel reports time
that none of the timers cover as untimed.

